2-Centre   (linear)     D-H...X most prob. angle 160 deg  - also: G.A.Jeffrey & W.Saenger, Hydrogen Bonding in Biological Structures
3-Centre (bifurcated)   SUM of 3 angl. about H = 360 deg                    Springer-Verlag, Berlin, 1991, pp 20.
